%%if database%%
Database-enabled binaries also support `migrate` and `rollback`.
`migrate` applies pending embedded migrations; `rollback` reverts the
application's latest reversible migration, never one shipped by Forge (such as
the cache or rate-limit tables). `seed` runs `seed` in `src/bootstrap/seeds.rs` in one
transaction with `FORGE_MIGRATION_DATABASE_URL`; keep it idempotent.
%%end%%
